        <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-base">🔍</span><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm">SEO technique</h3><p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-500">{techVerdicts[2].detail}</p></div></div>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
        {tech.seo.map(s => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 py-1">
            {s.ok ? <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-green-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                  : <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>}
            <span class={`text-xs ${s.ok ? 'text-neutral-600' : 'text-red-500'}`}>{s.item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </details>
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl p-5 bg-white border border-neutral-200 flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">🔧</span>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-800">580 avis travaillent pour vous sur Maps — ils peuvent travailler sur Google aussi.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 mt-1">Une page locale avec Schema.org LocalBusiness + horaires + tarifs + parcours cadeau = vos 580 avis en rich snippets et vos visiteurs convertis sans appel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6. METHODOLOGIE -->
<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 border-t border-neutral-200">
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4">Comment ca marche</h2>
  <ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">
    {[
      'On scrape votre site — on lit chaque page comme un visiteur le ferait',
      'On audite la technique — vitesse, securite, referencement, donnees structurees',
      `On cree ${kpis.nbPersonas} profils realistes — adaptes a votre secteur et votre zone`,
      'Chaque profil visite votre site — premiere impression, parcours, decision',
      'On compile : frictions recurrentes, canaux efficaces, recommandations concretes',
    ].map((step, i) => (
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-500 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">{i+1}</span>
        <span>{step}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 text-xs text-neutral-500">
    <strong>Note :</strong> 5 visiteurs donnent une tendance. 20 (Echo Complet) la confirment. 100 (Echo Pro) la prouvent statistiquement.
  </div>
</section>

